e":"Syracuse QB Steve Angeli exits with injury, arm in sling","description":"Syracuse senior quarterback Steve Angeli left Saturday's game against Boston College with an injury to his throwing arm and will not return.","published":"2026-11-21T20:51:03.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50552810/syracuse-qb-steve-angeli-exits-injury-arm-sling","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 12 live: Tracking top moments and best highlights","description":"Tracking the top plays and developments from Week 12.","published":"2026-11-21T18:35:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50541394/week-12-live-highlights","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Army pulls seating prank at Navy's football stadium ahead of Memphis game","description":"The letters were adjusted back in time for Navy's kickoff.","published":"2026-11-21T18:47:15.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50551457/army-navy-seat-prank","type":"Story","byline":"Associated Press","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Keisean Henderson leads Houston to win after QB Conner Weigman ruled out","description":"Houston ruled out starting QB Conner Weigman vs. West Virginia due to injury and instead went with true freshman Keisean Henderson, the No. 4 recruit for 2026.","published":"2026-11-21T21:38:48.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50550966/sources-houston-qb-conner-weigman-henderson-start","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-21T16:04:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-21T16:00:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Michigan starts QB Bryce Underwood vs. UCLA; Andrew Marsh suspended","description":"Michigan started QB Bryce Underwood over Tommy Carr, who had started the past four games. WR Andrew Marsh, meanwhile, is suspended for Saturday's game vs. UCLA.","published":"2026-11-21T20:46:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50549879/sources-michigan-expected-start-bryce-underwood-vs-ucla","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4941011/john-nestor","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Nestor_(American_football)"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"John Nestor (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Nestor_(American_football)","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:29Z","intro":"John Nestor (born May 13, 2005) is an American football cornerback for the Minnesota Golden Gophers. He previously played for the Iowa Hawkeyes.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Nestor attended Marist High School in Chicago, Illinois. Coming out of high school, he was rated as a three-star recruit by 247Sports and committed to play college football for the Iowa Hawkeyes over offers from other schools such as Iowa State, Minnesota, Purdue, and Kansas."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"IOWA\nAs a freshman in 2023, Nestor played sparingly, but entered the 2024 season with an expanded role. He appeared in ten games that season, recording 14 tackles and a fumble recovery, after which he entered his name into the NCAA transfer portal.\n\nMINNESOTA\nNestor transferred to play for the Minnesota Golden Gophers. In week 2 of the 2025 season, he notched two interceptions, one of which he returned 29 yards for a touchdown, in a victory over Northwestern State. Nestor was named the Big Ten Defensive Player of the Week following a win over Wisconsin in the regular season finale, recording nine tackles with two being for a loss, two interceptions, and a fumble recovery."}]}}